VOICEBOX - Passive

3199 Will Emit A Sound When Doing Certain Actions.
Using Chat - 3 Random Sound Effects With A 1/3 Chance.
Sprinting - Will Emit A Sound After 1 Second Of Sprinting.
Egg Usage - Will Emit A Screech.


ACIDIC VOMIT - Attack

Upon Hitting A Player It Will Also Hit Nearby Players And Emit A Particle Effect.
The Player Hit By 3199's Normal Attack Will Be Unaffected By This.
(This wont work when near elevators)


LIMB EATER - Ability

While Using The Eat Item, 3199 Can Eat Parts Of Corpses.
Corpses Will Be 5 Parts In Total.
Arms - 2
Legs - 2
Head + Torso - 1

Eating Corpse Parts Will Heal 3199 50 HP.


EGG HATCHER - Ability / Passive?

3199 Will Have No Main Version.
Every 3199 Will Be The Same.
A 3199 Can Only Spawn 1 Unless Its 3199 Dies.
If 3199 Has A Full Egg And A Spawned 3199 Alive But Dies It Will Respawn.
3199 Can Respawn Their 3199 If It Dies.

While As 3199 An Egg Ui Will Appear In The Bottom Right.
Eating Corpse Parts Will Fill This Egg UI Meter.

Spawn Egg - 20 Corpse Parts Eaten

Respawn Egg - 30 Corpse Parts Eaten


HATCHLING - Passive

When A New 3199 Is Spawned It Will Be A Hatchling. (just a smaller 3199)
The Hatchling Will Have Reduced Stats And A Normal Attack.
It Will Take 1 Minute For A Hatchling To Fully Grow.
When Full Grown It Will Emit A Screech.
The Hatchling Will Show Its Growth By Growing Bigger Every 10 Seconds.
The Hatchling Would Also Only Be Able To Eat Corpses.
Eating A Corpse Part Will Advance The Timer By 10 Seconds.

HATCHLING STATS

500HP
14.5 Speed
Only Eating Ability


ACID PILE - Ability

3199 Will Spew A Pile Of Acid On The Floor.
This Will Cost Them 5 Corpse Parts.
Its Radius Will Be 9 Studs And It Will Deal 20 Damage A Second.
Acid Piles Last 30 Seconds And Have a Recharge Of 1 Minute.
(unusable near elevators)

